 "synopsis": "Frozen-foods maker and McDonald's and KFC supplier HyFun Foods is exploring an initial public offering to raise Rs 2,000 crore by late 2028, with preparations expected to begin in mid-2027. The company aims to fund capacity expansion as domestic demand accelerates due to convenience and quick-commerce, and it expects its revenue to more than double to nearly Rs 3,500 crore by FY28.",
